{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "22bfd1626368050b8a501993f0b7acebe4dca442eb9e28c8b95a60f41bc17ab7", "ja": "必見！　私たちの青春！", "zh": "必看！属于我们的青春！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b27396d2e9a2013adb84b59492522ba5f075d7cd66954b899f205e3365535e86", "ja": "短期特番は大好評。ふと、みんながアイドル\nではなく普通の女の子だったらどんなだった\nだろうと考えたプロデューサーに、紗代子は\n「アイドルには、アイドルなりの青春が\nありますから！」と言うのだった。", "zh": "短期特别节目大获好评。制作人忽然想到，如果大家不是偶像，而只是普通女孩，会是怎样的光景——对此，纱代子说道：\"偶像，也有属于偶像的青春！\"", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0a8bf447270138c07f63678dddaa07e7b164615fccde30e9b89bf96887a04e7d", "ja": "（短期特番が公開された。かなり話題になってる！\n狙い通り、大勢の人にリーチできたみたいだな）", "zh": "（短期特别节目播出了。引起了相当大的话题！看来和预想的一样，成功触及了很多人。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "941ae98620a9dd8fe2016ba0f7a8641a92446895bca6cdd05ecc5b20d2278efd", "ja": "……よし、フィッティングもOKだな。\n調整はすぐできるから、何かあれば言ってくれ。", "zh": "……好，试穿也没问题了。\n有需要调整的地方随时能弄，要是有什么情况就跟我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "0084a8a2a72678184130c996117b9c48bb663135fa08442a4a5c021a28534044", "ja": "今のところ、問題ありません。\nそれより、すっごく素敵な衣装ですね！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "目前没什么问题。\n话说回来，这套服装真是太棒了！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "58ab07fb4dfb0aef611161153a20b2882919ea75f6d25be1cf40569696fe4f54", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}ちゃん！\n番組公開されたけど、茜ちゃんたちの評判はどう？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}！节目公开了，小茜他们的评价怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "44bc3c0ce8da9039e29a91520e6b5d469686a04ff2f3cb525b47afa61a19fbb7", "ja": "狙い通り、好感度の削り合いじゃなく、みんなの\nイメージアップに繋がったよ。勝負は公演次第だな。", "zh": "正如计划的那样，不是互相削减好感度，而是提升了大家的形象。胜负就看公演表现了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "ee32da3ace36cc3f4db3828d3f8e7829e9fc6bed7ba18775df1f1ae21a7db19a", "ja": "にゃはは♪　いいね～、望むところっしょ？", "zh": "呀哈哈♪　不错嘛～正合我意，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "466ca9159e32651a929ffe4335986dd2d037b8347cc1dac5e90b80f4e50121b3", "ja": "うん。やっぱりアイドルとしての勝負の決着は、\nステージでつけたいもんね！", "zh": "嗯。果然还是想在舞台上，为偶像之间的较量分出胜负呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "417c976964d15c0d1cecf59d00a6ebd4e528f371cb276e9bbbb5bafbdee3180e", "ja": "フッ……アツいね、ふたりとも。けど茜ちゃんも、\n仲間の思いを背負っているッ！　負けられないのだー！", "zh": "哼……你们两个都很热血嘛。不过，小茜也背负着伙伴们的心意！可不能输啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "dec5a93fc9a96cba9febb4631bd3a218d071fcfc531651c966826e5017f3f69b", "ja": "トーゼン！　仲間も友達も見てるんだから、\n中途半端な勝負できないって！", "zh": "当然！同伴们和朋友们都看着呢，怎么能进行这种半吊子的比赛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "5395c2742f80d31f4e372ce942eea353588906d72ad7127801af6a32031c42ba", "ja": "……ニャ？　{$P$}ちゃん、\nどうしたどうした？　ボンヤリしちゃって。", "zh": "……喵？{$P$}，怎么啦怎么啦？发什么呆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "576284958113721eb9e1433f90cb45da2104401dc3f1b8cd62fc1bf55733a572", "ja": "え？　いや、何でもないよ。うん。", "zh": "诶？没，没什么。嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "879d8bc485ffaaa66befea66a1b0155d7f010c3fb41cf8d6280e426f60341424", "ja": "えー、なんか思わせぶり～。\nどったの？　{$P$}。", "zh": "诶——总觉得你话里有话～。\n怎么啦？{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e260d3be3f4e527b3a44c8b070c138cfdbdde2254426711fb976147870c78b50", "ja": "いや……本当に、大した事じゃないんだよ。\nごく個人的な感想っていうか……。", "zh": "不……真的不是什么大不了的事啦。\n只是我个人的一点感想而已……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "2e5b93e451dc2db01d6177e9f418dbacfa29df68bf8fdd4eb5e8327e4da4aeb7", "ja": "{$P$}！　いつも私たちの相談に\n乗ってくれるのに、自分だけ言わないつもりですか？", "zh": "{$P$}！明明总是听我们倾诉，却打算唯独自己什么都不说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0289b07143fc0a7d4974c754ff71e56ab03ea45fcd4df37f74fa2313871c69ff", "ja": "そうか……なら、雑談だと思って欲しいんだけど。\n今回、皆のプライベートな一面がよく見えたと思って。", "zh": "这样啊……那就当作闲聊吧。不过，我觉得这次，大家私下的一面都让我看得很清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7cb0e0aafbd68cffcd1392a6982491928257df01d9a6d0501685fd54ab159d06", "ja": "いつも見てる、アイドルとしてじゃなくて。\nひとりの女の子としての姿、っていうのかな。", "zh": "不是平时作为偶像看到的样子，而是作为一个女孩子的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "814c7703f6035af168fc8e6235e6100ce086514adeea10276b65b32e18e7603b", "ja": "ん～？　まあ、そういう企画だったし？", "zh": "嗯～？嘛，毕竟本来就是那样的企划嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "1d2729e4bfa93d73f6199d397e160daf6d054453911c289827532eb2e5be3f3d", "ja": "つまり{$P$}ちゃんは、素の\n茜ちゃんたちにドキッとしちゃった……ってコト！？", "zh": "也就是说，{$P$}被本色的小茜们弄得心里一跳……是这个意思！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "68d5ab4c4be7e906ac36db9ac6222a4a055f559e17e234a3916d186d63eae252", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて。……もしも皆がアイドルに\nなってなかったら、どうだったのかなって。", "zh": "不，不是那样。……我只是在想，要是大家没有\n成为偶像的话，会是怎样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "882988c08cd158e8efd551d8834ba3e0ce7fc52a7051b253c6203eb3a4b3fb35", "ja": "普通の女の子としての時間が、もっとあったはずだろ？\n芸能界は、少し特殊なところだからな。", "zh": "作为普通女孩的时光，本来应该会更多的吧？\n演艺圈毕竟是个有些特殊的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "eb5a7f2be709073835972a7f3de531864365e86fca361531119726bb4e7d4229", "ja": "でも俺がそれを言うのは、今更だと思ったんだ。", "zh": "但是，我觉得现在再说这些，已经太迟了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "cadb1bd862813dfcc63b9818b15ea3369413faffe30cbec89508321e0ba018ee", "ja": "そーそー、今更だよ{$P$}ちゃん！\nそれに、茜ちゃんはいつだって、今が最高なのだ！", "zh": "就是嘛，现在才说已经晚啦，{$P$}！\n\n而且，小茜无论何时都是当下最棒的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "3741258bb492d9b00e138bc54570205b8a4ad5752358a517c9a004d1d4f03696", "ja": "アタシも、楽しくなかったら続けてないしね♪\n{$P$}は心配性だな～！", "zh": "我也是因为开心才坚持到现在的嘛♪\n{$P$}真是爱操心啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "0f470b211982aca440d6e7d28171da3bcc1d5ded4a54cc60a846cc5604989459", "ja": "……みんな、覚悟を決めてここまで来てるんですよね。\n普通の青春とは、すこし違うかもしれませんけど……。", "zh": "……大家都是下定决心，才一路走到这里的吧。\n或许，这和普通的青春有些不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "cc109727572a19c9e88cf3d5be09de5298770321d1db1a93153609f63b9396af", "ja": "アイドルには、アイドルなりの青春がありますから！", "zh": "偶像也有属于偶像自己的青春！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "222505399ddd2fbc455e6e9a6a2e91e885a571211d75c6a0f1d3b720d6cb3dec", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n変な事言って悪かった！", "zh": "嗯，你说得对。\n是我说了奇怪的话，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "1843f7724d3fa7bf1bbaed7739376fe84f2dc2ba0c95329a7460ad2b1186a8a3", "ja": "あ、でもその代わり……ってワケじゃないけど。\nちゃんと責任は取ってよね、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊，不过，也不是要你用这个来补偿……但你可要好好负起责任哦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "b1269ae7369d96ffd6afd46819f953c5dae3c325a78a4f3010fe9a5db4b76423", "ja": "うむ！　{$P$}ちゃんとしての\n責任、それはつまり……。", "zh": "嗯！作为{$P$}的责任，也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1030_027say", "source_sha256": "b6299a4cf084b2f556e8d469866f1d70ac91621c897af6993412ea6e3a128dc7", "ja": "アイドルとしての、私たちのステージ……\nこの勝負を、最後までしっかり見ていてくださいね！", "zh": "作为偶像，我们的舞台……\n请您一定要好好看到这场比赛的最后哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "c3ac84ef6bde1d4ededea1417a443514926149bf0b861a9c3d231bb1cbd2106b", "ja": "もちろん！\nちゃんと、目に焼き付けておくよ！", "zh": "当然了！\n我会好好把这一切烙印在眼里的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
